Description: HDMI capture passthrough appliance with subtitle overlay
 Grabs 1080p60 video and audio from a V4L2/ALSA capture device (the
 UltraSemi CV105) and outputs it through DRM/KMS and vc4-hdmi on a
 Raspberry Pi 5, with an optional SRT subtitle overlay, an MJPEG web
 preview, and a whisper.cpp transcription tap.
 .
 The package installs the subtitler.service systemd unit (enabled and
 started on install), creates the subtitler service user, and serves
 the appliance web interface on port 8080.
